{"id":"7ba09ad1e61f0c97","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property.md","title":"Amalgamation Property","display":"df-elementary-amalgamation-property — Amalgamation Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property","aliases":["17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property"],"display":"df-elementary-amalgamation-property — Amalgamation Property","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-df-5.4.1b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-amalgamation-property — Amalgamation Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-5.4.1b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> 为固定的可定义类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>。类记号及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal K)\">\\(\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal K)\\)</span> 是对其定义式逐次展开的元语言模式；量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span> 仅约束集合编码的结构，不量化类对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\\)</span> (elementary embeddings, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> (function composition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AP}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{AP}_L\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal{K})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathcal{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{C}\\in\\mathcal{K}\\\\\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{C})\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathfrak{D}\\in\\mathcal{K}\\;\n\\exists f&#39;\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{D})\\;\n\\exists g&#39;\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{C},\\mathfrak{D})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}(f&#39;\\circ f=g&#39;\\circ g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal{K})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathcal{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{C}\\in\\mathcal{K}\\\\\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{C})\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathfrak{D}\\in\\mathcal{K}\\;\n\\exists f&#39;\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{D})\\;\n\\exists g&#39;\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{C},\\mathfrak{D})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}(f&#39;\\circ f=g&#39;\\circ g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The quantifiers over the span and its two embeddings are universal.  The\namalgam and both comparison embeddings are existential and remain inside\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{K}\">\\(\\mathcal{K}\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 为固定的可定义类，见 [[17-df-structure]]。类记号及 $\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal K)$ 是对其定义式逐次展开的元语言模式；量词 $\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K$、$\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K$ 仅约束集合编码的结构，不量化类对象。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L$ (elementary embeddings, see [[17-df-elementary-embedding]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\circ$ (function composition, see [[17-df-set-functions]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AP}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{AP}_L(\\mathcal{K})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\mathcal{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{C}\\in\\mathcal{K}\\\\\n&\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{C})\\\\\n&\\exists\\mathfrak{D}\\in\\mathcal{K}\\;\n\\exists f'\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{D})\\;\n\\exists g'\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{C},\\mathfrak{D})\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}(f'\\circ f=g'\\circ g).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{K}","display":false}],"bytes":1882,"backlinks":[{"id":"5b4c86c70dd29331","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]] 的 $\\operatorname{AP}_L$ 使用初等嵌入；两者的映射资格不同，不能直接把它用在模型完备化判据中。[[17-df-fraisse-class]] 中的有限结构应用也不替代本条的全模型量化。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-df-elementary-extension]]\n[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[17-df-embedding]]\n[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-existentially-closed]]\n[[17-df-filter]]\n[[17-df-filters]]\n[[17-df-first-order-language]]\n[[17-df-formula]]\n[[17-df-formula-consequence]]\n[[17-df-fraisse-class]]\n[[17-df-free-variable]]\n[[17-df-generated-filter]]\n[[17-df-generated-substruc